        621.7548828125
      ],
      "text": "blinding not well detailed; 2 control patients treated in Clindamycin group after 24 hours when deteriorating (results still analysed with intention to treat); study ceased early due to rate of",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        65.48490142822266,
        116.40167236328125,
        74.69290161132812,
        621.4910278320312
      ],
      "text": "non-concurrent controls, assessment based on the Newcastle-Ottowa Quality Assessment Scale for Cohort Studies (Selection 4*/4*, Comparability 1*/2*, Outcome 3*/3*):",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        55.484901428222656,
        297.2268981933594,
        64.69290161132812,
        621.7548828125
      ],
      "text": "given the large differences in antibiotic regimens used as comparisons, studies cannot be analysed as a group",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.48490142822266,
        382.7149353027344,
        114.69290161132812,
        621.4910278320312
      ],
      "text": "blinding & allocation concealment not detailed adequately – quality downgraded",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.48490142822266,
        445.0301513671875,
        84.69290161132812,
        615.1181030273438
      ],
      "text": "minimal controlling for confounders reduces comparability",
